  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Finely chop the onion. Crush or finely chop the garlic. Combine the breadcrumbs and 2 tsp olive oil in a bowl and season with salt and pepper. Using your fingertips, massage to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1370602/photos/large/243367_1-8158fcf9a89688f5d7cbbb3a5f56de86.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start sauce: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium saucepan over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion, stirring, for 4-5 mins until softened. Add the garlic, half the tomato paste and 3 tsp Italian seasoning and cook, stirring, for 1 min or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1370603/photos/large/243367_2-850f5fbc8cd6dd7c50e02cbe4a9f9753.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Finish sauce: Add the tomatoes, 1 tsp sugar and 125ml (½ cup) water to the onion mixture and bring to a simmer. Taste, then season with salt and pepper. Add the ravioli to the sauce and gently toss to combine. Cook for 2 mins or until heated through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1370604/photos/large/243367_3-2c58eb29d3998115e8ac9b804a063ea5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake ravioli: Pour the ravioli mixture into a 1.5L (6 cup) baking dish and scatter over the breadcrumb mixture and remaining Italian seasoning. Bake for 10 mins or until the ravioli is al dente and the breadcrumbs are golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1370605/photos/large/243367_4-67748553711fa9d215a8955141720ff9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dress salad and serve: Meanwhile, combine 2 tsp olive oil and 2 tsp white wine vinegar in a large bowl. Add the salad leaves, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat. Pop the pasta bake and salad on the table for everyone to help themselves. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1370606/photos/large/243367_5-5ee6b0c70f3ef80250ea13bfc891742f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Empty out the crisper drawer and boost your salad by adding whatever you have on hand, from avocado and cucumber to capsicum and tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1370608/photos/large/243367_6-6008943387a372362a097cc2b5e7fe2e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
